WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:04.550
Format your interior

2
00:00:05.057 --> 00:00:08.689
The Format tab sets how the printed book and ebook look.

3
00:00:08.692 --> 00:00:20.865
Pick an interior theme. Each one sets the fonts, chapter openings and ornaments.

4
00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:28.683
Choose a trim size. These are Amazon KDP's standard sizes.

5
00:00:28.685 --> 00:00:35.554
Then the paper, the type size and the line spacing. The page count updates as you go.

6
00:00:35.557 --> 00:00:41.194
The print specification lists the margins, gutter and spine width KDP will ask for.
